## ✅ Want a Full Health View for a Specific Pod?

Here’s a minimal **dashboard-style query group** for one pod:

```prometheus
kube_pod_container_status_ready{pod="...", namespace="..."}              # 1 = ready
kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{pod="...", namespace="..."}     # total restarts
(time() - kube_pod_start_time{pod="...", namespace="..."}) / 60          # age in minutes
```

Replace `...` with your exact pod name + namespace.

